<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="AMO" style="id">Amosa</book>
  <para style="h">Amosa</para>
  <para style="toc1">Amosa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Amosa</para>
  <para style="mt">Amosa</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Juda lal Uzia te, Israel lal Joasa fapa Jeroboama te lal lai, lîrnghîn hma kum hnihah khân, Tekoa berâm vêngtu Amosa chuan Israel-te chungchâng inlârna hetiang hian a hmu:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />‘Zion tlâng aṭangin Lalpa chu ring takin a au va, Jerusalem khua aṭangin a lo ri hum hum a, Berâm tlatna hmuna hnimhringte chu a ro zo va, Karmel tlângchhîpa hnimte pawh a ro zo ta,’ a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Damaska mite chu chin tâwk nei lovin an sual a, Ka hrem ngei ngei dâwn a ni. Gilead mite chu buhvuakna thîrkut zumin An hai hrep avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An lal Hazaela inah mei ka chhuah ang a, Ben-hadada in chu a kâng chhe vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Damaska khaw kulh kawngkhâr chu ka tichhia ang a, Aven ruama chêngte chu ka tiboral ang a, Beth-edena lalte pawh an boral bawk ang, Suria mite chu Kir ramah salah an hruai ang,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Gaza mite chu chin tâwk nei lovin an sual a, Ka hrem ngei ngei dâwn a ni. An mi mante Edom hnênah salah an hralh ṭhîn a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tichuan, Gaza khaw kulh bang chungah mei ka chhuah ang a, An lal inte chu a kâng ral ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Asdod mite chu ka tiboral ang, Askelon rorêltute nên, Ekron mite chungah kut ka thlâk ang a, Filistia mi la awm chhunte chu an boral ang,” Lalpa P athian chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Tura mite chu chin tâwk nei lovin an sual a, Ka hrem ngei ngei dâwn a ni. An mi mante Edom hnênah salah an hralh a, Unau thuthlung an bawhchhia a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Chuvângin, Tura khaw kulh bang chungah mei ka chhuah ang a, An lal inte a kâng ral vek ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Edom mite chu chin tâwk nei lovin an sual a, Ka hrem ngei ngei dâwn a ni. A unaupa khandaih nên a ûm a, Lainatna rêng nei lovin a sawisa a. A thin a ur êm a, a thinrim rêng a reh thei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Chuvângin, Teman khuaah mei ka chhuah ang a, Bozra khuaa lal inte chu a kâng ral ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Amon mite chu chin tâwk nei lovin an sual a, Ka hrem ngei ngei dâwn a ni. An ram zauh duhin Gilead hmeichhe nau pai pumte lam an taithlêrsak a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chuvângin, Raba khaw kulh chu ka hâl ang a, An lal inte chu a kâng ral ang. A kâng ri chu indo nia au thâwm leh Thlipui tleh vut vut ang hi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An lal chu, an miliante nên, salah an hruai ang,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Moab mite chu chin tâwknei lovin an sual a, Ka hrem ngei ngei dâwn a ni, Edom lal ruh ro chu vâp vek khawpa an hâl avângin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Chuvângin, Moab ramah mei ka chhuah ang a, Keriot khuaa lal inte a kâng ral ang a, Indona tawtawrâwt ri leh sipai au tuar tuar zîngah Moab mite chu an thi ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An rorêltu chu ka tiboral ang a, An milian zawng zawng pawh ka that vek ang,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Juda-te chu chin tâwk nei lovin an sual a, Ka hrem ngei ngei dâwn a ni. Lalpa Dân an ngainêp a, A thupêkte an zâwm hek lo, An pate biak ṭhin milem pathian khân a hruai bo ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Chuvângin, Judai ramah mei ka chhuah ang a, Jerusalem-a lal inte chu a kâng ral ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Israel-te chu chin tâwk nei lovin an sual a, Ka hrem ngei ngei dâwn a ni. Thamna lain mi dikte an tuartîr a, Pheikhawk bun khat lek avângin mi retheite an hralh a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lei vaivutah retheite lu an rapbet a, An kawng ata pachhiate an nam kiang a, Pafain an chhiahhlawh nula an zen ṭâwm a, Ka hming thianghlim an tibawrhbâng a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Maichâm awmna apiangah, puan dahkham chungahte an mu a, An pathian ina lei an chawitîr chuan zu an lei a, an in a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sidar thing anga sâng, sasua anga khauh, Amor-ho chu an hmaah chung lama an rah leh hnuai lama an zung lamin Tihchhiatsak a nih kha le!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amor-ho ram luah tûrin Aigupta ram aṭangin ka hruai chhuak che u a, Thlalêrah kum sawmli chhûng ka kaihruai che u a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Zâwlnei atân in fate zînga mi leh Nazarit mi atân in tlangvâlte zînga mi ka ruat a, Chutiang chuan ka enkawl che u a ni lâwm ni?” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Mahse, Nazarit mite chu zu in pe a, Zâwlneite pawh thu hril in khap a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Chuvângin, buhphal phur vûm thûr tawlailîr chîk ṭuah ṭuah angin Ka tihrehawm ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tlân chak pawh a him lo vang a, âwmkhauh pawhin a chakna a chhawr thei lo vang. Mi huaisen pawh a inhum thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Thalkâp mi pawh an ṭang zo lo vang a, Mi ṭuanṭha pawh a tlân hman lo vang, Sakawr chuang mi pawh a inhum thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Chumi ni chuan râlhrât zînga huai berte pawh Ruakin an tlânchhia ang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Nangni, Aigupta ram ata ka koh chhuah, Israel chhûngte u, Lalpa sawisêlna che u hi ngaithla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khawvêla chhûngkua zawng zawng zîngah Nangni chauh hi ka hriat in ni asin, Chuvângin, in suahsualna zawng zawngah Ka hrem ngei ngei ang che u,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />An thurual zet loh chuan Mi pahnih an zin dûn ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sa hauh nei lovin ngawah Sakeibaknei a rûm ngai em ni? Sa seh nei lovin pûkah Sakeibaknei vânglai a rûm dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Leia thang kam tawktarh awm lovah Sava a âwk ngai em ni? Eng mah âwk lovin lei ata Thang chu a per dâwn em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Râlkhêl tawtawrâwt khawpuia a rîk chuan Mi tinin an hlau dâwn lâwm ni? Lalpa thu lovin khawpuiah thil ṭha lo a thleng ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />A rawngbâwltu zâwlneite hnêna a thiltum hrilh lovin Lalpa P athian chuan eng mah a ti ngai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sakeibaknei a rûm a, tu nge hlau lo vang? Lalpa P athian chuan thu a sawi a, Tu nge puang lo ngam ang?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Asdod khaw lal inahte puang ula, Aigupta lal inahte pawh hril rawh u, Samari tlângah pung khâwm ula, Chuta an buai nuai nuaizia leh An intihduhdah nasatzia chu en teh u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thil tih âwm leh âwm lo dâwn nachâng an hre tawh lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. Mi thil an chhuhsak leh an lâksakte chu, An in ṭha pui puiah an chhêk khâwm thêr thûr mai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Ram chu hmêlmain an rawn hual ang a, Kulhte chu an rawn tichim ang a, In lal inte pawh an rawk ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Berâmpuin sakeibaknei ei lai A beng them leh a keṭhiah pahnih tal A chhuhsak hrâm angin, Samari rama Israel-te chu An khum them leh a ke bung them chauh nên Chhan chhuah an ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Ngaithla ula, Lalpa chhûngte hrilh rawh u,” Lalpa P athian , Engkim Pathian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“An bawhchhiatna avânga Israel-te ka hrem ni chuan Bethel-a maichâmte chu ka tichim ang a, Maichâm kite pawh ka titliak ang a, Leiah a tla rem rum ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />An thlasik in leh nipui inte ka tichhia ang a, Sainghova chei inte chu a chhe rem rum ang a, In lian pui puite pawh a chim vek ang,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Nangni Samari nuho Basan bâwng anga thau, Retheite nêkchêpa, pachhiate rapbeta, ‘In tûr han la rawh,’ pasalte hnêna ti ṭhînte u, He thu hi ngaithla teh u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Lalpa P athian Thianghlima chuan heti hian a ti: “Ngai teh u, nite a lo thleng mêk a ni, Thil kawmin an hnûk ang che u a, Nghakuaiin an kai ang che u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Kulh bang pawp hnai berah An hruai chhuak ang che u, Hermon-ah an khalh khâwm ang che u,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Bethel-ah lo kal ula, bawhchhe leh ta che u le! Gilgal-ah phei chuan bawhchhe zual sauh ula, Tûk tin inthawi ziah ula, Ni thum danah sâwma pakhat pe ula,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lâwmthu sawi nân chhang hlân ula, Mahni tâna in thilpêkte pawh uanpui ta che u! Aw Israel-te u, chûng chu in tih châk zâwng tak a ni si a!” Tih hi Lalpa P athian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“In khawpuiahte ei tûr in tlachham a, Hmun tinah ṭâm ka tlâktîr a, Mahse, ka lam in lo hawi duh chuang si lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Buh seng hun thla thum vêlah ruahtui ka tikang a, Khaw khatah ruah ka sûrtîr a, Khaw dangah ka sûrtîr lo va, Hmun khata ruah a sûr laiin Hmun dang a ro va.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Tui in tûr zawngin khaw hrang hrang an pan ṭâwk ṭâwk a, Mahse, duh tâwk an hmu si lo. Chutichung pawhin ka lam an lo hawi duh chuang lo,” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“In thlaite thli lum ka chhêmtîr a, Ka tiṭâm zo va, in huan te, in grep te ka tiram a, In theipui te, in oliv-te khauvin a ei zo va, Chuti chung pawhin ka lam in lo hawi duh chuang si lo,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />“Aigupta rama hripui ang kha in zîngah ka lêntîr a, In tlangvâlte khandaihin ka that a, In sakawrte ka mansak che u a, In bûkah, tuar har khawpa rimchhia Mi ruang ka awmtîr ṭeuh va. Chuti chung pawhin ka lam in lo hawi duh chuang si lo,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Sodom leh Gomora khua ka hrem ang khân, In zînga mi ṭhenkhat ka hrem a, Meipui ata thingthu pawh chhuah ang in ni, Chuti chung pawhin ka lam in lo hawi duh chuang si lo,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Chuvângin, aw Israel, i chungah thil ṭha lo ka ti dâwn, Ka tih ngei dâwn avângin Aw Israel, I Pathian tâwk tûrin inpeih rawh.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Pathian chuan tlângte a din a, Thlîte a siam a, A duhzâwng chu mihring a hriattîr a, Chhûn leh zân a siam a, Lei pum chungah ro a rêl a ni, A hming chu Lalpa , Engkim Pathian a ni.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Israel mite u, in tâna ka ṭah hla hi ngaithla teh u:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nula Israel chu a tlu a, A tho leh tawh rua lo, A ram ngeiah a tlu, tu khaw ngaihsak lohvin, Tu man an kaitho lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan heti hian a ti: “Indo tûra Israel khawpui aṭanga Mi sângkhat thawk chhuak zîngah za chauh an dam ang a, Mi za thawk chhuak thei zîngah sâwm chauh an dam ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Israel mite hnênah Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Min zawng ula; tichuan, in nung ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bethel-ah mi zawng suh u, Gilgal-ah kal hek suh u, Beer-seba pawh pan suh u. Gilgal mite chu salah an tâng dâwn a, Bethel pawhin hlutna a nei tawh lo vang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa zawng ula; tichuan, in nung ang, Chutilo zawng, Josefa chhûngte chungah Mei angin a lo thawk dah ang e, Bethel mite a kâng ral vek ang a, Tu man an ṭhelh thei lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Nangni hleih nei taka rorêla, Thu dik hnâwl ṭhînte u, In châk lo vang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Siruk leh chhohreivûng siama, Thim chu zîng ênga chantîra, Chhûn êng chu zân thima chantîra, Tuifinriat tuite kova, Lei chunga sûrtîrtu hi A hming chu Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ani chuan mi chakte a titlâwm thut thut a, An kulhte a tichhe mai ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Rorêlna hmuna dik taka rêltu chu an hua a, Thu dik sawi ṭhîn chu an ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Chuvângin, mi retheite in rapbet a, An buhte in lâksak a, Lungchherin in lian pui pui in sa a, Mahse, in luah lo vang. Grep huan ṭha tak tak in siam a, Mahse, a tui, uain chu in in lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />In bawhchhiat nasatzia te, In sualzia te ka hria, Mi dik in tiduhdah a, Thamna in la a, Pachhiate ro dik takin in rêlsak duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Mi fing tân ngawih mai hun a ni e, Hun ṭha lo tak a nih hi!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil sual ti lovin thilṭha tih tum ula, Tichuan, in nung ang, ‘ Lalpa , Engkim Pathian chu kan hnênah a awm,’ In tih ṭhin ang hian in hnênah a awm tak tak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sual chu hua ula, thil ṭha chu ngaina rawh u, Dik takin ro rêl ṭhîn ula, Tichuan, Lalpa , Engkim Pathian chuan, Josefa thlah la damte chu a khawngaih mial mahna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Lalpa , Engkim Pathian, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: “Kawtthlêr tinah an ṭap chuah chuah ang a, Mualzâwlahte an chiau vak vak ang. Loneitute ṭap tûrin an pun ang a, Ṭah thiamte an ruai ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Grep huan tinah an ṭap tlawk tlawk ang a, Anni chu ka hrem dâwn a ni,” Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nangni, Lalpa nî lo thlen nghâkhlelte u, In tân a va râpthlâk dâwn êm! Lalpa ni chu engah nge in nghahhlelh le? Êng ni lovin thim a ni dâwn asin!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Sakeibaknei laka tlân chhuaka, Savawm tâwk ta emaw, Mahni ina hawa, bang han khawiha, Rûlin a lo chuk tâk ang hi a ni ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Lalpa ni chu êng ni lovin thim a ni zâwk dâwn, Hlimna nî ni lovin lungngaihna nî a ni zâwk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />In kûtte hian mi ngei a, ka ning ta e, In khâwmpui urhsûnte ka lâwm hek lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Hâlral thilhlan leh thlai tharte rawn hlân mah ula, Ka pawm lo vang. Remna thil hlan atâna in ran châwm thau in hlante pawh Ka ngaisâng lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />In zai a bengchheng êm e, titâwp rawh u, In ṭingṭang ri pawh ka ngaithla peih lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Rorêlna dik chu lui angin luang zâwk sela, Dikna pawh luipui kang lo angin luang rawh se.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Israel chhûngte u, kum sawmli chhûng Thlalêrah khân inthawina leh thilhlan; Ka hnêna in rawn hlan a ngai em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />In kutchhuak, in lal Sakut lim in bia a, In arsi pathian milem Kaiuan chu in biak tâk hi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Chuvângin, Damaska piah lamah Salah ka hruai ang che u,” Engkim Pathian, a hming Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Zion tlânga nuamti taka awm der dera, Samari tlânga thawveng taka awm veng vengte, Hnam azawnga hnam ropui Israel, An milian, mipuiin an pan ṭhinte chan tûr chu A va râpthlâk dâwn êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Kalne khuaah kal ula, hawi vêl rawh u, Hamat khaw ropuiah kal leh ula, Filistia khua Gath-ah chhuk thla teh u, Judai leh Israel ram aiin an ram chu a ṭha zâwk em ni? Zauh pawh a zau zâwk em ni?
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hun ṭha lo, lo thleng mai tûr lakah hian I inchhungêng vei a, I awm dân hian i chhiatna tûr a tihnai sauh a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Saingho khuma mua, Ṭhutna dûpa ṭhu zâla, Berâm rual zînga a no thlan chhuah sa leh Bâwngno chum sa ei ṭhînte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Perhkhuang nêna hla lênglâwng saa, Davida anga phuah belh zêlte u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Zu no lian pui pui dawma, Hriak rimtui inchulha, Jakoba thlahte vânduaina pawi tihpui hauh si lote u, In chan tûr chu a va râpthlâk êm!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Chuvângin, sala hruai hmasak ber in ni ang a, Nuam tâwla in ri bûng bûng chu a tâwp ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan a hming chhâlin heti hian a ti: “Jakob-ho chapona ka ten a, An in ṭha pui puite ka ngaimawh a ni. An khawpui chu a chhûnga awm nên ka mantîr vek ang,” Tih hi Lalpa , Engkim Pathian thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Thi bâng in pakhatah mi sâwm tawm khâwm mah se, An thi tho vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Laina ruang hlâwmtuin ruang a rawn lâk dâwnin in chhûngrila awm hnênah, ‘Awm a la awm em?’ a ti ang a. Ani chuan, ‘Awm tawh lo,’ a lo ti ang. ‘Ngawi hlauh rawh, Lalpa hming kan lam palh ang e,’ a ti ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa chuan thu a pe a, “In ropuite chu a chhe rem rum ang a, In tête pawh a sawm vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lungpui hmunah sakawr a tlân ngai em ni? Chutah chuan bâwngin lei a let ngai em ni? Nangni zawng, in rorêl chu tûr ang a ni a, Dikna ṭhatna chu thil khaah in chantîr a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lo-debar khaw tê tak tê chu in la a, in chhuang hle a, ‘Karnaim khua pawh la thei khawpin kan chak,’ in ti a;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ngai teh u, Israel chhûngte u, nangmahni bei tûrin, Hnam dang ka rawn tîr dâwn, Hmâr lam Hamat aṭanga Araba phai Thlengin an tiduhdah ang che u,” Lalpa , Engkim Pathian thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan hei hi mi hmuhtîr a: Ngai teh, hnim ṭo hmasa, lal chanpual an ah zawha Hnim a chawr ṭan leh laiin khau rual a tihpun chu ka hmu a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ram chhûnga hnim an ei zawh hnu chuan, “Aw Lalpa P athian , ngaidam teh, Jakoba chu engtin nge a din chhuah zawh ang, Amah lah a nêp hle si a?” tiin ka ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa chuan a khawngaih ta êm êm a, “A nih leh chu thil chu thlenglo vang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan hei hi mi hmuhtîr leh a: Ngai teh, Lalpa P athian chuan a mite hrem nân mei a ko va; Tuithûkpui chu a kâng ral a, Ram pawh a kâng ṭan ta a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Kei chuan, “Lalpa P athian , titâwp teh, Jakoba chu engtin nge a din chhuah theih ang, Amah lah a nêp hle si a,” tiin ka ngên a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan a khawngaih ta êm êm a, “A nih leh chu thil pawh chu thleng lo vang hmiang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Lalpa chuan hei hi mi hmuhtîr leh a: Ngai teh, bang ngîl tak bulah a ding a, sahal a khai a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, ‘Amosa, eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. Kei chuan, “Sahâl khai,” ka ti a. Lalpa chuan: “En teh, ka mi Israel-te en dik nân Sahal ka khai ta a ni, Ka ngaizam dâwn tawh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Isaka hmunsângte chu tihram a ni ang a, Israel Hmun Thianghlimte chu tihchhiat a ni ang. Jeroboama chhûngte lalna chu ka titâwp ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bethel puithiam Amazia chuan heti hian Israel lal Jeroboama chu a hrilh a: “Amosa hian Israel mite zîngah a sawichhe chiam che a, mipui a hmin zo dâwn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Amosa chuan heti hian a ti ṭhîn. ‘Jeroboama chu khandaiha thah a ni ang a, Israel-te chu an ram ata salah an hruai ang,’ tiin.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Tin, Amazia chuan Amosa hnênah, “Aw zâwlnei, kal la, Judai ramah tlân la, chutah chuan i ei hmuh nân thu va hril rawh. Bethel-ah hi chuan thu hril tawh suh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Lalin Pathian a biakna, hnam pum inthawina hmun a ni si a,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Tichuan, Amosa chuan Amazia chu a chhâng a, “Ei zawn nâna zâwlnei ka ni ve lo, berâmvêngtu leh theipui enkawltu mai ka ni a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Mahse, Lalpa chuan ka berâm vêng lai min la a, ‘Kal la, ka mi Israel-te hnênah thu va hril rawh,’ ” min ti a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tûnah Lalpa thu hi ngaithla teh, “Nangin, ‘Israel-te do zâwngin thu hril suh, Isaka thlahte demin thu puang hek suh,’ min ti a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Chuvângin, Lalpa chuan heti hian a ti: I nupui chu khawpuiah nawhchizuar a ni ang a, I fanu te, i fapate khandaihin an that ang. I hmunhma chu an insem darh vek ang a, Nang pawh hnam dang ramah i thi ang. Israel-te pawh an ram ata sala hruai bo an ni ngei ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa P athian chuan hei hi mi hmuhtîr a: Ngai teh, nipui thei hmin ṭuah bâwma awm hi a lo ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />“Amosa, eng nge i hmuh?” a ti a. Kei chuan, “Nipui thei hmin ṭuah, bâwma awm,” ka ti a. Lalpa chuan ka hnênah, “Ka mi Israel-te tâwpna tûr chu a ṭuah ta, Ka pêl mai mai dâwn tawh lo,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Lalpa P athian thuchhuak chuan heti hian a ti: “Chumi ni-ah chuan lal ina hlim taka zai ṭhînte chu Lungchhe takin an ṭap ang. Hmun tinah mitthi ruang a awm pheng phung ang a, Ngawi rengin an paih ang.”
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />“Nangni, tlachhamte rapbeta, Ram chhûnga retheite ei zawh duh hialte u, Hei hi hre rawh u,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />‘Thla thar kût ral thuai thuai se, Buh hralh a nghahhlelhawm mang e, Sabat ni ral thuai thuai sela, Chhangphut zawrh a châkawm mang e, Efa kan titê ang a, sekel kan tirit ang a, Bûkna dik lo kan hmang ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Buh nawi ruh khâwm lam kan hralh ang a, Tangka chuan mi rethei kan lei ang a, Pheikhawk bun khatin pachhia kan lei ang,’ in ti thîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Jakoba chhuan Lalpa chuan mahni inchhâlin thu a tiam a, A thil sual tih pakhat mah ka theihnghilh lo vang,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Chuvângin, an ramah lîr ka nghîntîr ang a, A chhûnga awm zawng zawng pawh an mangang hle ang, Aigupta ram Nail luipui a liana a kâm leh ṭhîn angin, Ram pum chu a sângin a hniam ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni ka tithim ang a, Chhûnah khua a thim vek ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />In kût nite chu invuina ni-ah ka chantîr ang a, In hlimna hlate chu khawhar hlaah, In za-in saiip puan ka ventîr ang che u a, In lu pawh ka tikawlh vek ang. Fapa mal sûn angin ka siam ang che u a, A tâwp thlengin a hrehawm tluanchhuak ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ngai teh, ni chu a lo thleng e, Chumi hun chuan ram chhûngah ṭâm ka tlâktîr dâwn, Tui leh chaw ṭâmin an ṭâm lo vang a, Lalpa thu ṭâmin an ṭâm ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Lalpa thu hriat châkin chhak leh thlang, Chhim leh hmâr an fang ang a, An hmu zo chuang lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Nula tlangvâl chak laite pawh Tuihâlin an chau vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Samari khuaa milem betute, Dan khuaa pathian lem chibai bûktute leh Beer-seba milem pantute chu an tlu ang a, An tho leh tawh lo vang.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Lalpa chu maichâm bula a ding ka hmu a, “Tempul ban chu a lêrah vaw vak la, A pumin nghîng sela, chim rawh se, A chhûnga awm zawng zawng delh sela, A thi bângte chu khandaihin ka tihlum ang a, Pakhat mah an tlân chhuak lo vang. Tu mahin an pumpelh hek lo vang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Seol thlengin kua hreuh chhuk mah sela, Chuta ta chu ka hnûk chhuak ang, Vânah khian lâwn chho mah sela, Chuta ta chu ka pawt thla ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Karmel tlângchhîpah biru mah sela, Ka zawng chhuak ang a, ka man ang. Tuifinriat mawngah min bihrûksan pawhin, Chutah chuan rûlpui ka chuktîr ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An hmêlmaten salah pawh hruai sela, Khandaihin ka sah hlumtîr ang a, An ṭhatna tûr ni lovin An chhiatna tûrin mit ka lên ang,” a ti a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Engkim Lalpa chuan, Lei hi a han khawih a, a lo tui ta a, A chhûnga awm zawng zawng chuan lu an sûn ta a, Aigupta ram Nail luipui a lian a, A kâm leh ṭhîn angin, Ram pawh chu a sângin a hniam a.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Ani chuan vânah khian chênna tûr in a sa a, Vân kûmkulh chu leiah a nghat. Tuifinriat tuite a ko va, leiah a sûrtîr a, A hming chu Lalpa a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Aigupta ram aṭanga Israel-te hruai chhuaktu ka ni lâwm ni?” Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti. “Kaftor ram aṭangin Filistia mite ka la chhuak a, Suria mite pawh Kir ram aṭanga ka hruai chhuah an ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ngai teh, Lalpa mit chu ram sual chungah a fu a, Lei ata ka tiboral ang. Jakoba chhûngte erawh chu ka tichhe vek lo vang,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Ngai teh, thu ka pe ang a, Chhihri-a buh an hrîkin lungtê a tla tel ve lo angin, Ka mi Israel-te chu hnam tin zîngah ka hri ang a,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Mi sual zawng zawng chu khandaihin ka that ang a, Chûng mite chuan, ‘Thil ṭha lo kan tawng lo vang a, Thil ṭha lovin min tibuai hek lo vang,’ an ti ṭhîn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Chumi ni-ah chuan Davida ram tluchhe tawh chu Ka tungding leh ang. A chhe laite pawh ka thawm ang a, Tûn hmaa mi ang khân ka din thar leh ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Edom ram la bângte an nei leh ang, Ka hming lam ṭhîn hnam zawng zawngte nên.” Hêng thil titu Lalpa thuchhuak chuan a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Ngai teh, nîte a lo thleng e,” Tih hi Lalpa thuchhuak a ni: “Leileh hun thlengin buh an la seng ang a, A phun leh hun thlengin grep an la sâwr ang Tlâng aṭang te chuan uain thlum a luang chhuak ang a, Mualah te chuan a luang dûl dûl ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Ka mi, Israel, sala tângte chu Ka hruai kîr leh ang a, An khaw ramte an din leh ang a, an luah leh ang. Grep-te an phun ang a, A uain an in ang a, Huante an siam ang a, Thlai tharte an ei bawk ang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Anmahni ram ngeiah ka awmtîr ang a, Anmahni ka pêk ram ata chu tu man an la chhuak tawh lo vang,” In Pathian, Lalpa chuan a ti.
  </para>
</usx>
